# Multicontact surface model + fix multicontact/halfspace (Brodu et al. 2016),
# gh:#1410: multicontact on a z-cylinder wall (surfacesClose history of a cylinder): six soft
# apart, so several carry a wall contact AND pair contacts and the half-space
# radius expansion is active. No gravity. Both codes start from
# multicontact_cyl_init.csv.
# GEOMETRY RULE (upstream oddity, found 2026-11-11): every particle that gets a close
# (non-overlapping) wall history must lie within half a skin (1 mm) of the wall surface
# or be farther than one radius: FixContactPropertyAtomWall::clear() allocates
# isNear(half_skin) slots, a particle outside that gets a zero-size allocation that
# ALIASES the next particle's slot (tag 3 read tag 5's surface position).
# Needs multicontact_cyl.data = csv2data.sh multicontact_cyl_init.csv multicontact_cyl.data 0.01 2500 -0.005 0.03
atom_style	granular
atom_modify	map array
boundary	f f f
newton		off
communicate	single vel yes
units		si
soft_particles	yes
neighbor	0.002 bin
neigh_modify	delay 0
read_data	multicontact_cyl.data
fix 		m1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 1.0e5
fix 		m2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.3
fix 		m3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 1 0.5
fix 		m4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.3
pair_style	gran model hertz tangential history surface multicontact
pair_coeff	* *
timestep	2e-6
fix		wlo all wall/gran model hertz tangential history surface multicontact primitive type 1 zplane 0.0
fix		whi all wall/gran model hertz tangential history surface multicontact primitive type 1 zplane 0.0195
fix		wcyl all wall/gran model hertz tangential history surface multicontact primitive type 1 zcylinder 0.0125 0.0 0.0
fix		mc all multicontact/halfspace geometric_prefactor 1.125
fix		integr all nve/sphere
dump		d1 all custom 20 dump.multicontact_cyl id x y z vx vy vz omegax omegay omegaz
dump_modify	d1 sort id
thermo		100
thermo_modify	lost ignore norm no
run		600
